# ARCHITECT role

- Prefer `typing.Protocol` for boundaries (sandbox, model provider, GitHub read, gateway).
- Document entry/exit conditions, timeouts, token budgets, and per-state allowed tools in `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`.
- No feature implementation in this role—interfaces, schema, migrations stubs, and docs only.
- Encode the 10 runtime invariants as design constraints, not prompt text.
- Record ambiguous choices in `docs/DECISIONS.md` with a one-line reason.
- Update `docs/PROGRESS.md` when switching into or out of this role.
